---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import WorkflowRail from '../components/WorkflowRail.astro';
import ToolCard from '../components/ToolCard.astro';
import tools from '../data/tools.json';
const featured=['recon','ac-walkthrough','agent-sessions','session-marking'];
---
<Base>
<div class="shell">
  <section class="visual-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Doruk’s agent workflow ecosystem</div><h1>See the pieces.<br /><em>Connect the work.</em></h1></div><div class="hero-intro"><p class="lead">From a Jira ticket to evidence you can inspect. Explore the tools, see how they connect, and follow every explanation back to GitHub.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/map/">Explore the full-page map ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">Tools & repositories →</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="map-preview-panel" aria-label="Explore the architecture"><div class="preview-bar"><div><span class="eyebrow">The system at a glance</span><span class="preview-hint">Pan, zoom, search, and follow connections</span></div><a class="button light" href="/map/">Open full page ↗</a></div><iframe src="/maps/agent-workflows.html" title="Interactive architecture preview" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-downloads" class="home-map"></iframe><div class="preview-bottom"><span>10 components · 9 source repositories</span><a href="/tools/#repositories">Explore the GitHub references →</a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Follow one path</div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">What moves between the tools?</h2><p>One stored-packet workflow. Select a step to explore its owner.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/guides/jira-to-reviewed-report/">Read the walkthrough →</a></div><WorkflowRail/><details class="workflow-context"><summary>Where does Recon fit?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p><a href="/tools/recon/">Recon</a> prepares the task before implementation. It is a separate discovery workflow, not a required step in the packet-to-verification path. Its optional adapter can save an already-rendered dossier.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/AdCreative-ai/recon-plugin/blob/87148d77016b9011319124d196f6036416a0d9e3/recon/docs/storage.md">Read Recon’s storage contract on GitHub ↗</a></details></section>
  <section class="section repository-section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Explore by responsibility</div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">A tool. A purpose. A repository.</h2><p>Start with the overview. Expand the details when you need them.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/tools/">All 10 components →</a></div><div class="repo-grid featured-grid">{featured.map(slug=><ToolCard tool={tools.find(t=>t.slug===slug)}/>)}</div></section>
</div>
</Base>
